{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q12.material.recovered", "text": "案例：学生学习了“一次函数”后，李老师布置了一个家庭作业：提出一个关于“一次函数”的实际问题并加以解决，下面是小颖完成的作业。爸爸准备给我买一双新鞋，要求我运用所学知识测算出穿多少“码”的鞋，我通过测量，得到爸爸、妈妈和我的鞋长分别为26cm、22.5cm和21.5cm，其中爸爸、妈妈鞋上的标号分别为42码、35码，由于同一事物的不同度量单位之间具有函数关系，我猜想鞋长的码数与厘米数之间满足一次函数的关系，由此就可以算出我的鞋长对应的码数。对这个问题我的解答如下：设鞋长为cm，对应的是码，则与的关系为：（）将爸爸、妈妈鞋长的厘米数和对应的码数两组数值分别代入上式，，，解这个方程组得，，所以与的关系为。将代入上式，得，所以让爸爸给我买一双33码的新鞋。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 740, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1069, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q12"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.304.r004", "ntce.outline.304.r011", "ntce.outline.304.r017", "ntce.outline.304.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q12"], "word_count": 329, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 740, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1069, "next_source_question_nu