{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q13.material.recovered", "text": "下面是某教材“平行四边形”一章中“菱形”一节的主要内容。我们观察平行四边形的一组邻边，如图18.2-6，当这组邻边也相等时，这时的平行四边形也是一个特殊的平行四边形，有一组邻边相等的平行四边形叫做菱形。 菱形也是常见的图形，一些门窗的窗格、美丽的中国结、伸缩的衣帽架（图18.2-7）都有菱形的形象。你还能举出一些例子吗？ 对于菱形，我们仍然从它的边、角和对角线等方面进行研究，可以发现并证明（请你自己完成），菱形还有以下性质：性质①：菱形的四条边都相等；性质②：菱形的两条对角线相互垂直，并且每一条对角线平分一组角。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1148, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1407, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q13"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.304.r011", "ntce.outline.304.r015", "ntce.outline.304.r017", "ntce.outline.304.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2023a.q13"], "word_count": 259, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "20410402fc90288baba6f21340739fed5cd4b4ae164547d473d17120ccd258cc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1148, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1407, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_prec